            "title": "Is Bilibili a 2025 Comeback Story After Cost Cuts and Profit Focus?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Many investors are asking whether Bilibili, at around $24.77, is a comeback story in the making or a value trap, and whether the current price really reflects its long term potential. The stock is up 2.1% over the last week but down 6.1% over the past month, while still sitting on a 44.6% gain year to date and 29.1% over the last year. This rollercoaster profile hints at shifting market conviction and risk appetite. Recent headlines have focused on Bilibili tightening its cost structure and...",
